  "description": "The PublicFunction.Converter library is designed for converting between various data types and strings in C#. It provides a set of classes, each tailored for a specific data type (e.g., StringService, IntService, DoubleService, etc.). Each class typically includes methods for converting to and from its type, as well as handling nullable types and exceptions. This library streamlines type conversion, ensuring type safety and reducing runtime errors.",
  "id": "PublicFunction.Converter",
